  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - 'I acknowledge your competency. I admit, your performance has exceeded expectations.

'
  - "However, let\u2019s not get ahead of ourselves. You are still far from matching
    the level of your predecessors.\r\n\r\n"
  - "Let\u2019s see how well you fare in the next galaxy. Prepare yourself for a
